B.a3v=new A.az('Last updated: May 2026\n\nThis Privacy Policy describes Our policies and procedures on the collection, use and disclosure of Your information when You use the Service and tells You about Your privacy rights and how the law protects You, particularly under the Personal Data Protection Act (PDPA) of Thailand (\u0e1e\u0e23\u0e30\u0e23\u0e32\u0e0a\u0e1a\u0e31\u0e0d\u0e0d\u0e31\u0e15\u0e34\u0e04\u0e38\u0e49\u0e21\u0e04\u0e23\u0e2d\u0e07\u0e02\u0e49\u0e2d\u0e21\u0e39\u0e25\u0e2a\u0e48\u0e27\u0e19\u0e1a\u0e38\u0e04\u0e04\u0e25 \u0e1e.\u0e28. 2562).\n\n1. Data We Collect (\u0e02\u0e49\u0e2d\u0e21\u0e39\u0e25\u0e17\u0e35\u0e48\u0e40\u0e23\u0e32\u0e40\u0e01\u0e47\u0e1a\u0e23\u0e27\u0e1a\u0e23\u0e27\u0e21)\nWe may collect the following personal data to provide and improve our service:\n\u2022 Profile Information: Name, Email Address, and authentication data.\n\u2022 Location Data: Used for finding nearby travel destinations and matches.\n\u2022 Usage Data: Swipes, likes, group interactions, and preferences within the app.\n\n2. How We Use Your Data (\u0e27\u0e31\u0e15\u0e16\u0e38\u0e1b\u0e23\u0e30\u0e2a\u0e07\u0e04\u0e4c\u0e43\u0e19\u0e01\u0e32\u0e23\u0e43\u0e0a\u0e49\u0e02\u0e49\u0e2d\u0e21\u0e39\u0e25)\nWe use your data strictly to:\n\u2022 Provide and maintain our Service (e.g., matching you with travel spots).\n\u2022 Manage Your Account and personalize the experience.\n\u2022 Communicate with you regarding updates or support.\n\u2022 Analyze usage to improve our algorithm.\n\n3. Data Disclosure (\u0e01\u0e32\u0e23\u0e40\u0e1b\u0e34\u0e14\u0e40\u0e1c\u0e22\u0e02\u0e49\u0e2d\u0e21\u0e39\u0e25)\nWe do not sell your personal data. We may share information with:\n\u2022 Other users in your "Group/Room" (only necessary info like your votes or matches).\n\u2022 Service Providers (e.g., Google Maps API) purely for providing core functionalities.\n\n4. Your Rights Under PDPA (\u0e2a\u0e34\u0e17\u0e18\u0e34\u0e02\u0e2d\u0e07\u0e17\u0e48\u0e32\u0e19\u0e15\u0e32\u0e21\u0e01\u0e0e\u0e2b\u0e21\u0e32\u0e22 PDPA)\nUnder the Thai PDPA, you have the right to:\n\u2022 Request access to your personal data.\n\u2022 Request correction of inaccurate data.\n\u2022 Request deletion of your data (Right to be forgotten).\n\u2022 Withdraw your consent at any time.\n\n5. Contact Us (\u0e15\u0e34\u0e14\u0e15\u0e48\u0e2d\u0e40\u0e23\u0e32)\nIf you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or wish to exercise your rights, please contact our support team.',null,B.BP,null,null,null,null,null,null)
